POST http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "userKey": "9hfWr1Z",
  "title": "Launched Personal Portfolio Website",
  "description": "Designed, built, and deployed a personal portfolio website showcasing projects and a blog.",
  "completedDate": "2025-09-15",
  "skills": ["int", "cha", "luc"],
  "isPublic": true
}

### Get achievement details by entityKey

GET http://localhost:8080/api/qry/achievement/detail?size=lg&entityKey=z6V28fW HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Add a Comment to the Achievement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement/JP5HVXl/comments HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
"achievementKey": "JP5HVXl",
"userKey": "9hfWr1Z",
"commentText": "Best achievmeent I've ever achieved"
}

### Update an existing Achievement
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement/PFBB8UQ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "achievementKey": "PFBB8UQ",
  "userKey": "nzxxb1b",
  "title": "A new updated title",
  "description": "A new updated description",
  "skills": ["str", "dex", "int"],
  "isPublic": false
}

### Disable an existing Achievement
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement/PFBB8UQ/disable HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Delete an existing Achievement
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement/PFBB8UQ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Add a Celebration to the Achievement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cmd/achievement/JP5HVXl/celebration HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
accept: application/json
X-API-Version: 1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "count":9
}